WEBVTT

00:00.510 --> 00:02.020
The story so far...

00:02.740 --> 00:06.570
I'm Saito Hojo,
a high school senior boy.

00:07.050 --> 00:07.950
Yo.

00:08.260 --> 00:09.470
- Grandpa?
- Grandma?

00:10.200 --> 00:12.490
Why are we called here?

00:12.490 --> 00:14.370
Get married.

00:15.880 --> 00:20.540
Due to some circumstances,
I got married to a girl I hate most in my class.

00:21.080 --> 00:22.170
I...

00:22.480 --> 00:24.000
I will get married.

00:24.000 --> 00:26.420
My spouse's name is Akane Sakuramori.

00:26.420 --> 00:30.220
We must keep this relationship
a secret from everyone.

00:30.220 --> 00:32.220
What were you talking about with Saito?

00:32.220 --> 00:33.220
Wha...

00:33.220 --> 00:35.520
You got married, didn't you?

00:36.430 --> 00:37.520
How did you...

00:37.520 --> 00:41.190
Our grandpa and his company
were acting strange, so I looked into it.

00:41.190 --> 00:44.820
But my cousin Shisei
has already found out.

00:46.550 --> 00:48.610
With our married life is full of turmoils,

00:49.030 --> 00:51.990
I wonder what will happen to us from now...

00:52.410 --> 00:55.060
#4 NIGHT ATTACK

00:55.060 --> 00:56.160
#4 NIGHT ATTACK
Stop.

00:56.160 --> 00:57.290
Stop, I said!

00:57.290 --> 01:00.040
Like hell I will!
I must survive at all costs!

01:00.040 --> 01:02.400
I won't kill you!
But if you don't stop, I'll shoot!

01:02.400 --> 01:03.790
With what?!

01:05.020 --> 01:06.300
I got hit...

01:06.650 --> 01:07.430
...not?

01:07.760 --> 01:10.330
Why didn't you bring your lunch?

01:11.090 --> 01:12.760
Sorry, I forgot.

01:12.760 --> 01:15.440
You forgot? Really?

01:15.440 --> 01:18.650
Truth is, you don't want
to eat my cooking, right?

01:18.650 --> 01:21.180
No, I'm actually happy
with your cooking.

01:21.180 --> 01:24.270
R-Really? Glad to hear that.

01:24.600 --> 01:29.530
I went all out in making that,
so you better eat it all, okay?

01:35.970 --> 01:38.220
Cousin, I'm hungry.

01:38.220 --> 01:39.910
Give me all your lunch.

01:40.270 --> 01:43.320
That's quite an absurd
and abrupt request...

01:43.320 --> 01:45.670
At this rate, I'll die of starvation.

01:45.670 --> 01:48.840
It is the older brother's obligation
to share food with his little sister.

01:48.840 --> 01:51.670
I bet you had all the breakfast
you could ever have this morning!

01:51.920 --> 01:53.580
I had three bowls of rice.

01:53.580 --> 01:54.940
See, you're eating more than me!

01:54.940 --> 01:56.620
This and that are two separate matters.

01:56.620 --> 01:57.560
No, it's not!

01:57.560 --> 02:00.520
I want to eat your wife's...

02:00.520 --> 02:03.040
I told you not to spew that
out of your mouth!

02:04.590 --> 02:10.150
Brother... I want to eat.

02:11.470 --> 02:13.220
Don't you feel sorry for her?!

02:13.220 --> 02:15.300
Give her some, will you?

02:15.300 --> 02:17.060
Or rather, just give it all to her!

02:17.060 --> 02:21.160
You're a super evil dude for not sharing!

02:21.490 --> 02:24.580
Fine, only a spoonful, okay?

02:24.580 --> 02:27.420
Oh? Saito, your lunchbox...

02:27.790 --> 02:29.300
Isn't it the same as Akane?

02:31.520 --> 02:32.300
You're right!

02:32.300 --> 02:34.020
Attagirl, Himarin!

02:34.020 --> 02:34.930
What's this?

02:34.930 --> 02:37.310
Is it Sakuramori's handmade lunch?

02:37.310 --> 02:39.560
So you two are really dating?

02:39.560 --> 02:41.520
N-No, we're not!

02:41.520 --> 02:43.070
You're getting all red.

02:43.070 --> 02:45.670
We're not dating at all!

02:45.670 --> 02:47.940
Yeah! No printer, just fax!

02:47.940 --> 02:49.690
We're married, though!

02:50.010 --> 02:51.980
But this does look fishy.

02:51.980 --> 02:55.480
You two already look like
a married couple too.

02:55.480 --> 02:58.200
The matching lunchbox must be proof.

02:58.200 --> 03:00.630
Let me explain...

03:02.580 --> 03:04.960
I told you only a spoonful!

03:07.690 --> 03:10.460
It's bad manners to talk while eating!
Swallow it first!

03:11.320 --> 03:11.960
Gulp.

03:11.960 --> 03:13.780
I ate it in one spoonful.

03:13.780 --> 03:14.880
What are you, a monster?

03:14.880 --> 03:18.170
I don't deny that I'm a being
beyond human understanding.

03:18.170 --> 03:19.470
For real?

03:19.890 --> 03:21.410
You'd better thank me.

03:21.410 --> 03:24.850
I erased the evidence for you.

03:24.850 --> 03:26.120
Really?

03:26.120 --> 03:28.770
Nah, I just wanted to eat.

03:29.660 --> 03:33.360
Cousin, are you doing okay back home?

03:41.620 --> 03:43.490
Saito!

03:47.780 --> 03:49.800
Don't jump off the stairs.
It's hazardous.

03:49.800 --> 03:53.590
Don't worry.
You'll catch me when I trip.

03:53.590 --> 03:56.220
Oh, don't you dare involve me.
I'll dodge you at all costs.

03:56.220 --> 03:59.590
What a meanie!
You won't be popular with girls like that!

03:59.590 --> 04:01.330
I don't need to be.

04:02.270 --> 04:03.850
That's so you!

04:06.310 --> 04:07.600
By the way...

04:08.230 --> 04:13.110
Akane didn't actually
make you lunch, did she?

04:13.680 --> 04:16.730
We just used the same frozen food.

04:16.730 --> 04:21.410
Well, it's safe to assume
that she just tried to copy me.

04:21.410 --> 04:22.680
Really?

04:22.680 --> 04:23.620
Really.

04:24.070 --> 04:26.710
So you two... aren't dating, right?

04:26.710 --> 04:28.070
Well, duh.

04:28.070 --> 04:31.250
I see! I guess so!

04:32.490 --> 04:34.440
Sorry for the weird question.

04:34.440 --> 04:37.080
I'll go get things straight
with everyone for you.

04:37.080 --> 04:38.190
See ya!

04:50.390 --> 04:51.770
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL

04:51.770 --> 04:53.360
I HATE IN MY CLASS

04:53.360 --> 04:56.360
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN MY CLASS

06:11.270 --> 06:15.940
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN MY CLASS

06:27.800 --> 06:29.890
Something's here...

06:40.820 --> 06:43.760
What?! Is the Alpha Centauri invading?!

06:43.760 --> 06:45.790
A ghost! There's a ghost!

06:45.790 --> 06:48.890
It's looking pale and whispering something!

06:50.020 --> 06:51.290
There's nothing there.

06:51.290 --> 06:52.190
There is!

06:52.190 --> 06:53.890
Oh, yeah? Good night.

06:53.890 --> 06:57.990
Wake up! Don't leave me alone!

06:57.990 --> 07:00.640
Don't worry, you're not alone.

07:00.640 --> 07:03.070
Mother Nature and all Earthlings
are on your side.

07:03.070 --> 07:04.680
Don't just say random stuff and sleep!

07:04.680 --> 07:05.400
Go to bed!

07:05.400 --> 07:07.920
I can't! I won't let you either!

07:07.920 --> 07:11.120
What if my soul gets
taken away by the ghost?!

07:12.420 --> 07:14.350
What do you want me to do...

07:15.770 --> 07:17.750
I'll go check whatever's bothering you!

07:17.750 --> 07:20.130
No, stay here!

07:20.130 --> 07:21.990
But we must see for ourselves!

07:21.990 --> 07:23.160
Please!

07:30.430 --> 07:33.540
I can't... Gotta move out... Exorcise...

07:33.540 --> 07:35.590
Elaborate, please?

07:35.590 --> 07:38.190
There's the ghost again...

07:38.570 --> 07:42.550
I heard footsteps from
the living room while I was studying...

07:42.550 --> 07:44.690
Drap, drap... That's the sound...

07:44.690 --> 07:45.880
I see...

07:45.880 --> 07:48.200
Bring me back some photos
for evidence, then.

07:48.200 --> 07:51.780
As if I can do that! It might haunt me,
and my phone might explode!

07:52.100 --> 07:54.450
Ghosts these days sure
have the firepower.

07:55.380 --> 07:56.920
Why are you studying here?

07:56.920 --> 08:00.640
I'm just watching over you
so you won't get attacked by the ghost!

08:00.640 --> 08:03.390
I'm perfectly fine.
Go back to your room.

08:03.390 --> 08:07.090
I'm not going out, meow!
This is my room, meow!

08:10.130 --> 08:11.820
Where are you going?

08:11.820 --> 08:14.220
I'm taking a leak.
Stay in the room.

08:14.220 --> 08:16.790
Open up! Do your business
with the door open for tonight!

08:16.790 --> 08:17.850
Yeah, right!

08:17.850 --> 08:20.080
Even a dog would relieve itself in the open!

08:20.080 --> 08:21.190
I'm not a dog!

08:23.510 --> 08:26.130
I'm going to the bathroom.

08:26.130 --> 08:26.910
Sure.

08:31.390 --> 08:32.340
Um...

08:32.340 --> 08:33.330
What?

08:33.840 --> 08:36.580
It's dangerous for me
to take a bath alone,

08:36.580 --> 08:38.910
s-so could you...

08:39.350 --> 08:40.710
...come with me?

08:40.710 --> 08:41.710
Huh?!

08:42.060 --> 08:44.210
Can't you?

08:44.540 --> 08:47.180
All right, just for tonight.

08:55.460 --> 08:57.980
Hey, are you there?

08:58.350 --> 09:00.620
You're there, right?!
Are you okay?!

09:00.620 --> 09:03.230
The world is me and I am the world...

09:03.670 --> 09:06.230
Why aren't you answering?!
Want me to get mad?!

09:06.230 --> 09:07.990
Put on a towel, will you?!

09:09.040 --> 09:10.950
That girl these days...

09:10.950 --> 09:12.380
Your wife grumbling?

09:12.380 --> 09:14.120
No, it's not that.

09:14.120 --> 09:16.410
How do you tell it's about Akane?

09:17.020 --> 09:18.950
I can tell by the way you sound.

09:18.950 --> 09:21.950
When you're tired of your married life,

09:21.950 --> 09:24.040
you'd run away to the comfort of my chest.

09:24.310 --> 09:27.620
I am the devilish woman
that heals such emotion.

09:27.620 --> 09:30.130
Enough with the dubious phrasing.

09:30.130 --> 09:31.280
But it's not.

09:31.690 --> 09:34.320
Everyone needs a place
to escape reality.

09:34.320 --> 09:36.660
You need me.

09:37.590 --> 09:40.180
And I also need you.

09:42.000 --> 09:45.340
Don't hold back.
Just give in to my comfort.

09:45.340 --> 09:47.760
With my overflowing tolerance,

09:47.760 --> 09:50.690
I will embrace your everything.

09:50.690 --> 09:52.770
It's dangerous, so get off there.

09:53.620 --> 09:56.180
So, what about your wife?

09:56.180 --> 09:59.450
Akane said she saw a ghost in our house.

09:59.850 --> 10:04.380
She's freaked out that the ghost would
stand near our bed, and make footsteps.

10:04.780 --> 10:07.460
So much that she can't take a bath alone.

10:07.460 --> 10:09.090
You're a pervert, Cousin.

10:09.090 --> 10:12.790
I'm not. We didn't actually
get in together in the end.

10:12.790 --> 10:15.540
But you actually wanted
to go together, right?

10:15.540 --> 10:17.220
As if.

10:17.220 --> 10:20.440
Perhaps it might actually be a ghost.

10:20.440 --> 10:21.480
Yeah, that's cap.

10:23.720 --> 10:27.230
I will investigate what's going on.

10:28.480 --> 10:31.490
Akane, you're married to my cousin, right?

10:32.910 --> 10:34.490
No!

10:34.490 --> 10:36.450
I see through everything.

10:36.450 --> 10:38.550
You two are living under the same roof...

10:38.550 --> 10:40.940
All right, let's go for a walk!

10:40.940 --> 10:43.500
Yeah, a walk together!

10:44.420 --> 10:46.980
Such flawless teamwork...

10:46.980 --> 10:49.000
So this is the power of marriage.

10:49.000 --> 10:53.100
Saito, I thought I told you not to
tell a living soul about us!

10:53.100 --> 10:54.590
What were you thinking?!

10:54.590 --> 10:58.050
I didn't tell her at all!
She just found out on her own!

10:58.050 --> 10:59.390
Right, Shisei?!

10:59.390 --> 11:03.970
Hang on. I can't remember the punchline
for the comedy show I watched last night.

11:03.970 --> 11:07.310
Who cares about that?!
My life is on the line here!

11:07.310 --> 11:11.180
Which one should I choose,
the punchline or your life...

11:11.180 --> 11:12.400
Don't get confused!

11:12.810 --> 11:15.100
There's no lie in his words.

11:15.500 --> 11:19.030
I looked into your marriage on my own.

11:19.370 --> 11:20.410
Really?

11:20.410 --> 11:24.470
No amount of people can fool my eyes.

11:24.470 --> 11:28.540
I guess there's no way
Saito's family wouldn't notice...

11:28.990 --> 11:31.800
Sorry for keeping this from you, Shisei.

11:31.800 --> 11:34.050
No problem.

11:34.390 --> 11:38.620
I heard from him that
you're troubled by a ghost at home.

11:38.620 --> 11:42.610
That's right! Not to mention,
he doesn't believe it at all!

11:42.610 --> 11:44.680
He can't tell the gravity of the situation!

11:45.020 --> 11:48.100
I can tell that house...

11:48.880 --> 11:51.070
...is possessed by evil spirits.

11:51.070 --> 11:52.070
I knew it!

11:52.070 --> 11:55.550
If we don't exorcise soon,
the calamity will spread.

11:55.550 --> 12:00.060
All your grades might go down
for 50 points each.

12:00.060 --> 12:03.330
Such disaster!
What should we do, Shisei?!

12:03.720 --> 12:06.910
All it takes is for me to see the house.

12:07.900 --> 12:10.580
Have faith in Shisei.

12:17.000 --> 12:18.550
My...

12:18.550 --> 12:20.220
What do you think, Master?

12:20.510 --> 12:23.150
A large amount of spirits is gathering.

12:23.560 --> 12:26.850
This house will soon sink into the afterlife.

12:26.850 --> 12:28.230
Shisei?!

12:28.230 --> 12:32.440
Does that mean we're too late?!
Maybe we should burn the whole house?!

12:32.440 --> 12:33.610
Don't be too rash!

12:33.910 --> 12:35.500
Fear not.

12:35.500 --> 12:38.270
I will get to the centre
of the psychic disturbance,

12:38.270 --> 12:40.990
and destroy it to disperse the spirits.

12:40.990 --> 12:43.490
Please, Master!

12:44.300 --> 12:45.430
What's this room?

12:45.430 --> 12:47.250
My studying room.

12:47.640 --> 12:50.920
I don't use it for studying,
so it's more like a reading room.

12:50.920 --> 12:53.470
For one of your indecent books?

12:53.470 --> 12:54.120
Saito...

12:54.120 --> 12:54.880
Nope.

12:54.880 --> 12:56.670
I know it all.

12:56.670 --> 13:01.070
That the books you read have
a lot of lewd scenes in them.

13:01.070 --> 13:05.140
When I try to peak,
you'd close the book in an instant.

13:05.140 --> 13:08.890
No porn is allowed in my house!
That's so filthy!

13:08.890 --> 13:11.900
It's just a normal novel!
Even movies have lewd scenes too, right?!

13:11.900 --> 13:14.520
I must investigate your lewd book room.

13:14.520 --> 13:15.910
It's not!

13:15.910 --> 13:17.840
I'll confiscate any dirty books.

13:17.840 --> 13:19.570
Why are we deviating now?

13:22.530 --> 13:23.810
Wow...

13:25.320 --> 13:27.970
Found your underwear, Cousin.

13:27.970 --> 13:29.910
What are you showing me?!

13:32.570 --> 13:34.490
Sniff, sniff...

13:34.490 --> 13:38.530
It doesn't smell of you,
but of detergent.

13:38.530 --> 13:39.920
It's been laundered.

13:39.920 --> 13:41.930
Well, duh!

13:43.130 --> 13:46.180
I will now investigate Akane's studying room.

13:46.180 --> 13:50.160
Wait, Shisei.
There are no spirits in my room.

13:50.160 --> 13:51.330
It's safe.

13:51.330 --> 13:54.120
You don't want me
to dig through your underwear?

13:54.120 --> 13:57.070
No, I don't!
Please just look for the spirits!

13:57.070 --> 13:59.190
It's more fun looking for underwear...

13:59.190 --> 14:00.730
No, it's not!

14:01.990 --> 14:05.920
I saw a shadow
when I was sleeping over there.

14:05.920 --> 14:08.450
It looked like a little child.

14:08.760 --> 14:13.000
Although, it disappeared
soon as I screamed.

14:13.530 --> 14:14.990
I see...

14:17.120 --> 14:18.630
Have you figured it out?

14:19.600 --> 14:20.840
Shisei?

14:20.840 --> 14:22.430
Give her some time.

14:23.760 --> 14:26.400
Right now, her brain cells
are working fast,

14:26.400 --> 14:28.930
to calculate all sorts of possibilities.

14:29.340 --> 14:32.280
She'll definitely come to the truth.

14:32.280 --> 14:35.560
I guess we can trust her...

14:38.290 --> 14:41.280
I think I know who the ghost is.

14:41.280 --> 14:42.090
You do?

14:42.090 --> 14:44.320
Must be a cat, right?
Or maybe a rat?

14:44.960 --> 14:47.230
The ghost...

14:50.700 --> 14:51.640
...was me.

14:55.330 --> 14:56.010
Huh?

14:56.010 --> 14:58.840
Um, what do you mean?

14:59.130 --> 15:03.000
I deduced it from
where and when the ghost appeared,

15:03.530 --> 15:06.340
and its moving patterns.

15:06.660 --> 15:08.210
The ghost was me.

15:08.600 --> 15:13.600
After all, I've been visiting your
house since a few days ago.

15:14.070 --> 15:15.870
Then say so!

15:17.350 --> 15:21.480
I see, so it was you...
Thank goodness...

15:21.480 --> 15:22.900
Then say so!

15:23.440 --> 15:27.160
Grandpa gave me the keys
right after I asked him.

15:27.160 --> 15:28.910
That old man...

15:29.320 --> 15:32.070
The reason I came visit in secret...

15:32.070 --> 15:36.290
...is so that I wouldn't be in the way
of your lovey-dovey moments.

15:36.290 --> 15:37.920
It's not lovey-dovey!

15:38.300 --> 15:42.970
Since I solved your case,
I want dinner as a reward.

15:42.970 --> 15:44.870
But you're the detective and the culprit!

15:44.870 --> 15:48.210
I ate Akane's handmade
lunchbox the other day,

15:48.210 --> 15:49.780
it was really good.

15:49.780 --> 15:51.180
R-Really?

15:51.480 --> 15:54.010
My mouth was super watering.

15:54.010 --> 15:56.190
Your cooking is world's finest.

15:56.190 --> 15:59.390
Well, obviously!
I guess some people can tell!

15:59.390 --> 16:02.630
Search the whole galaxy,
nay, the whole parallel universe,

16:02.630 --> 16:05.190
you won't find a better cook than me!

16:05.510 --> 16:08.440
I want to eat your cooking.

16:08.440 --> 16:10.570
I'm super hungry.

16:10.890 --> 16:14.330
I'll make all the meals you want!

16:19.440 --> 16:22.850
So good... This tastes like heaven.

16:23.700 --> 16:25.800
Glad it suits your taste.

16:25.800 --> 16:28.590
Let me know if you want anything else.

16:28.960 --> 16:30.620
Munch, munch...

16:31.490 --> 16:33.510
You got rice on your cheek again.

16:35.600 --> 16:36.680
Hey...

16:36.680 --> 16:37.690
What's wrong?

16:37.690 --> 16:39.600
Uh, nothing...

16:40.200 --> 16:43.910
Aren't they... too close?

16:46.760 --> 16:49.600
Cousin, you're so good.

16:49.600 --> 16:52.050
Right? Try for yourself.

16:52.050 --> 16:53.870
You know how to play, right?

16:55.130 --> 16:59.330
I do, but being in your arms...

16:59.330 --> 17:01.420
...feels so good...

17:01.880 --> 17:04.250
Hey, you two?

17:04.250 --> 17:05.560
Wh-What?

17:05.560 --> 17:06.500
It's nothing.

17:06.500 --> 17:09.590
It's definitely something.
You've been angry since earlier, right?

17:09.590 --> 17:10.900
I'm not!

17:10.900 --> 17:13.510
But you are! You look like a demon!

17:13.510 --> 17:15.850
How dare you call a girl a demon!

17:15.850 --> 17:17.520
I'll pull out all your front teeth!

17:17.520 --> 17:18.770
So scary...

17:20.000 --> 17:23.230
It's getting late.
I should wash myself.

17:23.230 --> 17:24.520
I'm going in too.

17:24.520 --> 17:28.030
Hey, isn't she the same age as us?!

17:28.030 --> 17:30.720
I always take a bath together with him.

17:30.720 --> 17:31.670
Always?!

17:31.670 --> 17:33.650
We rarely go in together recently!

17:33.650 --> 17:35.780
Recently?! Rarely?!

17:35.780 --> 17:39.160
Take a bath one by one!
Get going already!

17:39.160 --> 17:40.590
Yes, Sir!

17:44.900 --> 17:46.300
Where's Shisei?

17:46.770 --> 17:48.290
She's still gaming.

17:48.950 --> 17:52.300
I already prepared the bed for her.
She'll go to sleep eventually.

17:52.660 --> 17:54.820
Finally, we can talk alone...

17:54.820 --> 17:57.960
Hmm? Did you want to talk
with me alone?

17:57.960 --> 18:00.560
Not exactly...

18:00.560 --> 18:03.170
I have a lot of complaints to you!

18:03.170 --> 18:05.310
I can't just say them in front of Shisei!

18:06.030 --> 18:07.210
Complaints...

18:07.850 --> 18:08.820
I'm listening.

18:09.820 --> 18:10.890
Right...

18:11.360 --> 18:15.880
I wish you'd tell me sooner
if you bought that cat game.

18:16.450 --> 18:18.970
You've been busy with studying.

18:18.970 --> 18:20.830
I thought I'd disturb you.

18:20.830 --> 18:22.870
You wouldn't.

18:22.870 --> 18:26.020
I could use a breather too.
Besides...

18:26.620 --> 18:29.460
I wanted to play it first...

18:29.460 --> 18:32.840
You wanted to get better first
so you could wreck me?

18:32.840 --> 18:34.040
Talk about evil.

18:34.040 --> 18:38.080
Not that! I wanted to play it first
before Shisei...

18:38.080 --> 18:41.980
I don't get it!
Why did I want to play it first?!

18:41.980 --> 18:43.560
Don't ask me.
I wouldn't get it.

18:43.560 --> 18:46.010
You should! Since your grades
are so good for nothing!

18:46.010 --> 18:47.030
What do you mean?!

18:47.030 --> 18:50.010
I'm saying fish paste doesn't
need the latest computer!

18:50.010 --> 18:51.740
I don't remember being fish paste!

18:51.740 --> 18:54.090
How poor of you,
having your memories reforged!

18:54.090 --> 18:56.370
You're definitely fish paste!

18:56.370 --> 18:57.620
Definitely not!

18:58.840 --> 19:00.690
That's a load off my chest.

19:00.690 --> 19:04.070
I really should complain
to you once a day.

19:04.070 --> 19:06.940
You're saying as if you need
to hit a sandbag once a day...

19:06.940 --> 19:08.810
Enough with that, will you?

19:09.430 --> 19:10.880
Is that all?

19:11.180 --> 19:12.870
Oh, one more thing.

19:12.870 --> 19:13.820
What?

19:13.820 --> 19:16.020
Um, well...

19:16.020 --> 19:18.140
It's about Shisei...

19:18.560 --> 19:20.710
Sorry for having her stay over so suddenly.

19:20.710 --> 19:22.150
That's okay.

19:22.150 --> 19:24.390
She's so cute, after all.

19:24.810 --> 19:27.320
I mean, how do I put it...

19:27.320 --> 19:31.790
Aren't you pampering her too much?

19:31.790 --> 19:36.310
She's the type to eat random stones
off the ground if left unsupervised.

19:36.310 --> 19:38.280
Is there a problem?

19:38.620 --> 19:41.910
There's... no problem...

19:41.910 --> 19:43.720
There's not, but...

19:43.720 --> 19:47.240
Wait, why am I complaining to you?

19:51.100 --> 19:54.570
Hey, did you just rub my butt?!

19:54.570 --> 19:56.790
Huh?! No way...

19:57.950 --> 20:00.000
You're touching my thigh too!

20:00.000 --> 20:02.380
Why do I have to do
something so scary?!

20:02.380 --> 20:06.310
You're the scary one!
I'm not as reckless as to touch a dragon!

20:06.820 --> 20:08.590
What do you mean I'm a dragon?!

20:08.590 --> 20:11.820
I'll burn you to ashes,
not even a strand a hair will be left of you!

20:11.820 --> 20:13.330
That's what scares me about you!

20:13.330 --> 20:15.540
Silence. One is trying to sleep.

20:15.540 --> 20:16.380
Shisei?

20:16.380 --> 20:17.570
Since when you were here?!

20:17.570 --> 20:20.190
Since before human civilisation.

20:20.190 --> 20:21.200
Yeah, right.

20:21.590 --> 20:24.080
I will sleep with my cousin.

20:24.080 --> 20:27.460
Whenever he stays over,
we always sleep together.

20:27.460 --> 20:28.460
Always?

20:28.460 --> 20:32.590
Not always.
Only when she really wants to.

20:33.350 --> 20:37.640
I have been with him since I was a baby.

20:37.640 --> 20:41.850
It feels most calming when hugging him.

20:42.330 --> 20:46.320
I'm so lonely. It's unfair for you
to always be together with him.

20:46.320 --> 20:50.090
It's not! I'm not doing this because I like it!

20:50.090 --> 20:50.910
Really?

20:50.910 --> 20:55.710
Really! It's just a condition set by
our grandparents for our marriage!

20:55.710 --> 20:56.360
So...

20:56.700 --> 21:00.610
If you really want to sleep
alone with him, then so be it.

21:01.300 --> 21:03.490
I don't really want to!

21:03.490 --> 21:07.000
I will sleep on the floor
so you can have sex freely.

21:07.000 --> 21:09.810
We've never even done that,
and we don't intend to!

21:09.810 --> 21:13.250
Let's sleep together!

21:20.280 --> 21:22.960
So you get jealous too, Akane.

21:22.960 --> 21:24.280
What are you saying?

21:24.280 --> 21:28.600
You were angry because
I flirted with him, right?

21:28.600 --> 21:30.770
Huh? I wasn't.

21:30.770 --> 21:33.520
Nothing can fool my eyes.

21:36.430 --> 21:38.080
Are you blushing?

21:38.080 --> 21:39.310
I'm not.

21:39.310 --> 21:43.090
He's a slow one, so you must
be clear or he won't understand.

21:43.090 --> 21:44.780
What are you talking about?!

21:45.050 --> 21:46.740
I'm relieved.

21:47.280 --> 21:51.670
I was worried if he could
live peacefully here.

21:51.960 --> 21:53.670
What do you mean...

21:54.240 --> 21:55.730
Good night.

21:57.170 --> 21:58.800
You'd better explain yourself!

21:58.800 --> 22:02.920
And you're too close to him!
Have some shame, will you!

23:34.980 --> 23:40.840
#5 I WON'T LOSE
